Parameter Setting: Set the currently used objective lens to the closest available standard magnification (20x or 40x, selecting 40x for higher resolution closer to 30x request if exact 30x is unavailable, otherwise 20x if field of view is priority; assuming 40x is available and preferred for pathology detail); Set the filter set to brightfield mode.; 
